## 9. Learning Outcomes

Through this project, the following concepts will be explored:

- CMOS circuit design and simulation
- VLSI physical layout fundamentals
- Technology-specific design rules
- Physical verification using DRC
- Electrical connectivity verification using LVS
- Linux-based EDA workflows
- Version control and technical documentation

